          ___ ___ ___ ___ ___ ___                             ___ ___ ___ ___ ___ ___
          ___ ___ SPG WRP SPG ___                             GDN GDN GDN GDN GDN ___
          ___ SPG WRP WRP WRP SPG                             SPG FST WRP SLO PUR GDN
          ___ SPG WRP WRP WRP SPG                             SPG WRP WRP WRP WRP GDN
